  void desktop refresh [--user] [--no-icons] [--no-mime]

Commands:
  refresh                Rebuild desktop, icon, and MIME caches

Options:
  --user                 Only refresh caches under ~/.local (no sudo)
  --no-icons             Skip icon theme caches
  --no-mime              Skip the shared MIME database
  -h, --help             Show this help

Run these by hand instead if you prefer:
  sudo update-desktop-database /usr/share/applications
  sudo gtk-update-icon-cache -f -t /usr/share/icons/<theme>
  sudo update-mime-database /usr/share/mime

Examples:
  void desktop refresh
  void desktop refresh --user
EOF
}

